      "description": "Swift: @MainActor CustomerWallet(storage: WalletStorage = KeychainWalletStorage(), keepDays: 30, now:), an ObservableObject whose @Published items SwiftUI views observe. Kotlin: CustomerWallet(storage, keepDays = 30, now) with subscribe(listener). Bytes that cannot be read or opened count as an empty wallet; an import from the application's server brings the items back.",
